Nethack elves are, indeed, based primarily off of Tolkien's model.
There's too much Tolkien in Nethack (Lembas, cram rations, orcs, Uruk-
Hai, Olog-Hai, Elbereth, Sting, Orcrist, hobbits, even the old Elf
quest, the list goes on) to deny its influence.

As for the chaotic influence, I see it as Elves being based more off
of Mirkwood elves than the "high" elves.  Either that, or just to show
elven disdain for human society.

Anyway, the fact remains that Chaotic characters are not necessarily
evil, and it is a mistake to conflate those attributes.

- John H.

